        "doi": "10.1523/jneurosci.15-07-04748.1995",
        "title": "Dopamine modulates GABAc receptors mediating inhibition of calcium entry into and transmitter release from bipolar cell terminals in tiger salamander retina.",
        "authorString": "Wellis DP, Werblin FS.",
        "authorList": {
          "author": [
            {
              "fullName": "Wellis DP",
              "firstName": "D P",
              "lastName": "Wellis",
              "initials": "DP",
              "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {
